## Technical Implementation

### Factory Pattern Architecture
- PduParserFactory.java: Central factory for PDU parser selection
- Strategy Pattern: 10+ specialized parsers implementing PduParser interface
- Extensible design: Easy addition of new PDU types without code modification
- Type-specific optimization: Each parser optimized for specific PDU structure

### Comprehensive PDU Parser Support
**Core PDU Parsers:**
- EntityStatePduParser.java: Entity state and position updates
- FirePduParser.java: Fire event and weapon discharge data
- CollisionPduParser.java: Collision detection and response
- DetonationPduParser.java: Explosion and detonation events

**Advanced PDU Parsers:**
- DataPduParser.java: General data transmission PDUs
- ActionRequestPduParser.java: Action request and command PDUs
- StartResumePduParser.java: Simulation start/resume control
- SetDataPduParser.java: Data setting and configuration PDUs
- DesignatorPduParser.java: Target designation and marking
- ElectromagneticEmissionsPduParser.java: Electronic warfare and emissions

**Default Handler:**
- DefaultPduParser.java: Handles unknown or unsupported PDU types

### Kafka Consumer Configuration
- PduProcessingService.java: Main consumer service with @KafkaListener
- Concurrency Level: 3 parallel consumer threads for high throughput
- Consumer Group: "processing-group" for load balancing
- Auto-offset management with earliest offset reset
- Error handling for malformed messages and processing failures

### Database Persistence
- Spring Data JPA repositories for each PDU record type
- Transactional processing with @Transactional annotations
- Optimized entity mapping and relationship management
- Batch processing capabilities for high-volume data

