## Deployment Configuration

### Container Specifications
- Image: ghcr.io/nus-iss-projects/cap-backend-data-processing/cap-backend-data-processing:latest
- Ports: HTTP 8080
- Resources: CPU 100m-300m, Memory 384Mi-768Mi
- Health Probes: /api/processing/health (60s readiness, 90s liveness initial delay)

### Environment Variables
- SPRING_KAFKA_BOOTSTRAP_SERVERS: kafka:9092
- KAFKA_TOPIC: dis-pdus
- SPRING_KAFKA_CONSUMER_GROUP_ID: processing-group
- SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL: jdbc:postgresql://postgres:5432/dis_db
- SPRING_DATASOURCE_USERNAME: dis_user
- SPRING_DATASOURCE_PASSWORD: dis_pass

### Horizontal Pod Autoscaling
- HPA Configuration: 1-2 replicas, 85% CPU utilization threshold
- Automatic scaling based on Kafka message processing load

